@host = http://localhost:5122
# Вставьте сюда accessToken из ответа на login
@token = 

### 1. Регистрация (один раз после каждого запуска)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student@example.com", "password": "12345678", "passwordConfirm": "12345678" }

### 2. Получить JWT
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student@example.com", "password": "12345678" }

### 3. GET без токена → 200
GET {{host}}/api/products

### 4. POST без токена → 401
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Мышь", "price": 8000, "category": { "id": 1, "name": "Периферия" } }

### 5. POST с токеном → 200, createdBy
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "name": "Мышь", "price": 8000, "category": { "id": 1, "name": "Периферия" } }

### 6. GET по Id
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### 7. DELETE с токеном → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Изменённый токен (дописан лишний символ) → 401
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}x
